{
    "title": "Word Cross Jigsaw - Word Games",
    "description": "Brand new type of word search puzzle game!\r\n\r\nIt is a little bit crossword and a little bit jigsaw puzzle!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n\u2605Drag jigsaw blocks to fit them and make words\r\n\u2605Each level has a theme clue and all words are related to the clue\r\n\r\nAll words are hidden in the squares, carefully found and connect them.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\u26052000+ levels\r\n\u2605Beautiful graphics and visual effects\r\n\u2605Play offline at anytime\r\n\u2605Easy to play game for all ages\r\n\u2605Improve your vocabulary and Learn new words\r\n\u2605Huge range of categories \u2013 animals, celebrities, movies, travel & more\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for new games for mind sharpening and brain training, then the game is the one for you!\r\n\r\nIt mixes word search, jigsaw and trivia to create something completely fresh.\r\n\r\nDownload the game and start to challenge your brain now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Brand new type of word search puzzle game!<br><br>It is a little bit crossword and a little bit jigsaw puzzle!<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br>\u2605Drag jigsaw blocks to fit them and make words<br>\u2605Each level has a theme clue and all words are related to the clue<br><br>All words are hidden in the squares, carefully found and connect them.<br><br>FEATURES:<br>\u26052000+ levels<br>\u2605Beautiful graphics and visual effects<br>\u2605Play offline at anytime<br>\u2605Easy to play game for all ages<br>\u2605Improve your vocabulary and Learn new words<br>\u2605Huge range of categories \u2013 animals, celebrities, movies, travel &amp; more<br><br>If you&#39;re looking for new games for mind sharpening and brain training, then the game is the one for you!<br><br>It mixes word search, jigsaw and trivia to create something completely fresh.<br><br>Download the game and start to challenge your brain now!",
